     SWISS-PROT RESIDUE      PDB SEQRES

       NAME   NUMBER         NAME   CHAIN  SEQ/INSERT CODE
       ASP       84          ASN     E       79
       ILE       88          VAL     E       83

THE SEQUENCE FOR TRYPSIN IN THIS STRUCTURE WAS TAKEN FROM
GENEMBL WHICH DIFFERS FROM THE SWISSPROT SEQUENCE.
;
